    <string name="ai_hero_body">Book summaries, quizzes, the tutor and sourced answers are made with Gemini. When AI is off or unreachable, the classic methods take over.</string>
    <string name="ai_hero_title">AI with Google Gemini</string>
    <string name="ai_no_key_body">This build has no key; everything is done on the phone with the classic methods. A developer can add gemini.apiKey to local.properties and rebuild to turn Gemini on.</string>
    <string name="ai_no_key_title">No Gemini API key</string>
    <string name="ai_privacy_free_tier">On the free Gemini quota Google may use what is sent to improve its products and humans may review it; do not upload confidential or personal content. On the paid quota content is not used for that and is kept only for a limited time for abuse detection.</string>
    <string name="ai_privacy_off">If you turn AI off, summaries, questions and answers are produced entirely on the phone with the classic methods.</string>
    <string name="ai_privacy_sent">The text of the chapters being summarised and your questions are sent to Google (Gemini API) for processing. Text is sent as plain text, not as a PDF.</string>
    <string name="ai_privacy_title">Where does your data go?</string>
